The effective number of benchmarks behind an ECI can be summarized as $1 / \sum_b (\text{share}_{mb})^2$: about 7 for Claude 3.5 Sonnet and 10 for Claude Opus 5\.5, whose top four benchmarks (WeirdML v3\, Remote Labor Index\, FrontierSWE\, EBR\-bench) carry 55% of the weight.


